        <item>
            <title>1.1.6</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 11:11:00 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>9</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>Combined "Choose Folder..." and "Choose Images..." into one "Choose Folder or Images..." picker -- no need to know in advance which kind of thing you have before opening the panel.</li>
                    <li>Added drag-and-drop: drop a folder or images straight onto the Select Images stage.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/cadavidf/WatermarkFactory/releases/download/v1.1.6/WatermarkFactory.dmg" length="2299801" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="vTWuJyaRvS+dhAFsjl/sRdYKgVKrCz9lcvTLrTCOGcpw1P7WPgrgQZyIY0fdR0vOT9kZOa10F3D9gjEyNfFJBA=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>1.1.5</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 11:04:07 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>8</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>Fixed an inconsistency in the Watermark stage's Skip button: it could get you onto a later stage, but the progress nav and that stage's own Skip button were still silently blocked from going further, since only Skip itself bypassed the real gate. Fixed at the source -- viewing any stage now only requires images to be selected; the actual export action still correctly requires a watermark, unchanged.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/cadavidf/WatermarkFactory/releases/download/v1.1.5/WatermarkFactory.dmg" length="2292400" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="yeCMzn2dlQ87CHEMkuAZitVtqUwJ/a2zIbwGEtMaBak0ikZ5thQuuwma7IH3ao/rHB7Ql5s0Qa58ygoiIv2QCw=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>1.1.2</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 10:19:19 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>Fixed Chat mode: it never actually worked before (10s timeout vs ~28s real model latency meant every message silently fell back to the click-through flow). Now uses gemma3:4b (3-5s/turn), verified live in English and Spanish.</li>
                    <li>Fixed native controls (DisclosureGroup, Picker) showing the Mac's system accent color instead of Automality teal.</li>
                    <li>Added Sparkle auto-update -- this is the first version that can update itself.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/cadavidf/WatermarkFactory/releases/download/v1.1.2/WatermarkFactory.dmg" length="2321909" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Gi+iFUTbofWUM0IqidWPIdtN85kq6xjKWImExAkGdW4LDFomr5arCfA8QbnRriJU8Mu5DpB7w6sqeGy6H99TDw=="/>
        </item>
